blobs.518047d753cd:
// The pattern's "Kit" part — the SAME module and the same file as pad.k7x beside it. What
// makes these events sample one-shots rather than notes is that their sounds resolve to samples,
// which is a fact about the events and not about the lane.
extends("@meta/strudel-track")
strudel("algo/pattern.strudel")

blobs.6ed1857b380b:
// The rising C-major scale intro. Placeholder line until the real melody is written.
//
// TODO: write the actual melody; decide whether it doubles the bass.
//
// This was a `docs:`/`todos:` pair, read by a Docs panel that no longer exists. A note about
// something in the SIGNAL is a doc module on the graph now; a note about a lane's own file is
